  "text": "ABA · Module 3 Supplemental Readings Four readings on building new behaviour: chaining, differential reinforcement in practice, group contingencies, and shaping with successive approximations. Reading note:  Sources are the TARGET Texas Guide entry on chaining (2009); Wheatley and colleagues' Praise Note study ( Education and Treatment of Children , 2009); Chow and Gilmour's teacher's guide to group contingencies ( TEACHING Exceptional Children ); and an excerpt from Sundel and Sundel's chapter on shaping and response differentiation. Reference lists and study summaries are kept in collapsible sections and are not read aloud.",
